    {
      "type": "listeningComp",
      "audioUrl": "/audio/unit-24/testimonio-camara.mp3",
      "transcript": "Yo llevaba la cámara tres esa noche. Estaba grabando el escenario. La cantante cantaba y el público aplaudía. De repente se apagaron dos luces. Yo seguí grabando porque no podía moverme. Cuando volvió la luz, vi que la puerta de prensa estaba abierta. Antes estaba cerrada, se lo aseguro. No vi salir a nadie porque miraba por la cámara.",
      "translation": "I was on camera three that night. I was recording the stage. The singer was singing and the audience was clapping. Suddenly two lights went out. I kept recording because I could not move. When the light came back, I saw that the press door was open. Before it was closed, I assure you. I did not see anyone leave because I was looking through the camera.",
